# The prebuilt index IS committed on purpose. It is about 80 MB across four
# files, every one under GitHub's 100 MB limit, and shipping it is what lets a
# Render deploy come up with a working corpus and no build step.
# Anything the build script writes outside data/index is scratch:
data/scratch/
*.tmp
